// Bare layout: no status-bar, no tab-bar. Tabs still work via Alt+T / Alt+1-9 /
// Alt+Tab — they just stay invisible. Zellij stable cannot conditionally show
// the tab-bar only when more than one tab exists, so the next-best fit for
// the "only show when >1" intent is to hide everything until upstream lands
// that feature.
layout {
    default_tab_template {
        children
    }
}
